mary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Describe the bug\r\n\r\nI guess this is caused by https://github.com/sqlalchemy/sqlalchemy/pull/7381. When using it, all other attributes, e.g. `__table__` are forgotten by the table.\r\n\r\n### To Reproduce\r\n\r\n```python\r\nT = TypeVar(\"T\", bound=\"CommonBase\")  # noqa\r\n\r\nclass CommonBase(Generic[T]):\r\n\t@classmethod\r\n\tdef boring(cls: Type[T]) -> Type[T]:\r\n\t\treturn cls\r\n\r\n@as_declarative()\r\nclass Base(CommonBase[T]):\r\n\tpass\r\n\r\nclass Tab(Base[\"Tab\"]):\r\n       __tablename__ = \"foo\"\r\n\ta = Column(Integer, primary_key=True)\r\n\r\nassert Tab.__table__\r\n```\r\n\r\n\r\n### Error\r\n\r\nAttributeError: type object 'CommonBase' has no attribute '__table__'\r\n\r\n### Versions\r\n\r\nOS: Linux\r\nPython: 3.7.1\r\nSQLAlchemy: 1.4.28\r\n\r\n\r\n### Additional context\r\n\r\n_No response_","closed_by":{"login":"sqlalchemy-bot","id":36047385,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM2MDQ3Mzg1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/36047385?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sqlalchemy-bot","html_url":"https://github.com/sqlalchemy-bot","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sqlalchemy-bot/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sqlalchemy-bot/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sqlalchemy-bot/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sqlalchemy-bot/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sqlalchemy-bot/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sqlalchemy-bot/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sqlalchemy-bot/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sqlalchemy-bot/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sqlalchemy-bot/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sqlalchemy/sq